    "sphere_source": "A public NURBS sphere and its natural B-rep; this shares the same rational parameterization across file import and the SDK command. An earlier analytic-sphere sample-index comparison was invalid because angle and NURBS parameters differ. Its diagnostic and raw observations are retained.",
    "command_metadata_selection_undo_redo_verified": true,
    "complete_observations_unchanged_except_json_whitespace": true,
    "request_path_relocation": "The executed request uses absolute artifact destinations; the portable fixture differs only by storing their repo-relative names.",
    "source_model_tolerance": "Shared source files store 1e-8 and command replay decodes them at 1e-8.",
    "comparison": "Replay the exact source 3dm geometry through the command. Check unchanged spatial tables and neighboring faces, topology, senses, normalized surface and lifted-trim samples at 1e-8, explicit domains, metadata, undo/redo, and edited 3dm readback. All raw SDK and command observations, including differing Automatic size estimates, remain retained.",
    "sdk_size_query_differences": "The actual Rhino command and public GetSurfaceSize + BrepFace.SetDomain controls also disagree on curved inputs. The latter is retained as an independent diagnostic, not substituted for the actual command."
  },
